      "id": "math.ode.sf01_frobenius_method",
      "short_code": "SF01",
      "kind": "theorem_formula",
      "title": "確定特異点とフロベニウス級数解法（決定方程式）",
      "summary": "2階線形常微分方程式の確定特異点近傍において一般化されたべき級数解を仮定し、決定方程式と漸化式によって基本解を構成する方法。",
      "canonical_latex": "(x - x_0)^2 y'' + (x - x_0)p(x)y' + q(x)y = 0,\\quad y(x) = \\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty} a_k (x - x_0)^{k+r},\\quad r(r-1) + p_0 r + q_0 = 0",
      "aliases_latex": [
        "y(x) = (x - x_0)^r \\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty} a_k (x - x_0)^k",
        "I(r) = r(r-1) + p(x_0)r + q(x_0) = 0"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "Frobenius method",
        "regular singular point",
        "indicial equation",
        "フロベニウス法",
        "確定特異点",
        "決定方程式"
      ],
      "domain_tags": [
        "mathematics",
